      {
        "day": 78,
        "vid": "gen_2venh8f",
        "kcal": 1148,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Ananya, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 79,
        "vid": "gen_hajtdlm",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Domingo — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Domingo doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 80,
        "vid": "gen_2venh8f",
        "kcal": 1144,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Ananya looks it. You set your second half in front of Ananya. 'Eat,' you say. Ananya eats like someone making up for days."
